  "text": "## HOW TO MAXIMIZE INTEREST EARNED  \n### Strategy 1: Move Funds to Higher Tier  \n**Scenario:** You have £11,000\n```\nIf kept in Tier 1 (< £10k):\n- Only first £10,000 earns 4.50%\n- Interest earned: £450/year\n\nIf moved to Tier 2 (£10k–£50k):\n- All £11,000 earns 4.70%\n- Interest earned: £517/year\n- **Gain: +£67/year** (just by moving to correct tier)\n```",
